            "//FairyStoneOffering": "Prompt N2 (plan MASTER_PLAN N2, HW-B5 extended): vanilla NOT_USED_FairyStone offered back in the ring that yields it. The ring has no ordinary offering, so this is its only CardInteraction. The stone is consumed and vanilla Willpower (fb03747247e64ad4bbddcf328e0669ae, 0 to 250, base +1 a tick) rises by 30: half the King's price of 60 Willpower for two stones, so a stone returned never pays more than the King's bargain charged for it, and the King's bargain stays once a run. The 30 is a TUNABLE PLACEHOLDER, session-inferred and unmeasured against play, not balanced.",
